  <div class="msv__section">
    <div class="msv__container">
      <h2>Requirements Overview</h2>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">While specific requirements vary by permit type, here are the typical documents and conditions you'll need:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Valid passport (minimum 6 months validity beyond your intended stay)</li>
        <li>Proof of economic means (bank statements, employment contract, or pension documentation)</li>
        <li>Health insurance coverage (Spanish or valid EU policy)</li>
        <li>Proof of address in Spain (rental contract, property deed, or certificate of residence)</li>
        <li>Criminal records clearance from your country of origin (apostilled and translated)</li>
        <li>Current visa documentation or evidence of legal entry</li>
        <li>Application form signed and notarized (official model varies by autonomous community)</li>
        <li>Photographs (recent passport-style, per Spanish specifications)</li>
      </ul>
      <p style="margin-top: 1.5rem; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem;">Requirements may vary by autonomous community and permit type. We recommend confirming with your local provincial police station or consulting with a specialist for your specific situation.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

